CAMPAIGN_RANKING
1

OBJECTIVE_BEGIN
Adding Solaris to our influence in this system will further advance the Uprising against the Imperium. Being far from Imperium space, units in this hotzone should not organize a strong resistance. Only by both destroying all native enemy generators and gaining control of the hotzone’s citadels can we bring the planet under our control.
OBJECTIVE_END

SPYINFO_BEGIN
1
As the Imperium does not yet consider our movement to be a legitimate threat to its empire, we expect them to await your arrival at their citadel in the hotzone’s northeast. To aid efforts in breaking their defense and capturing their citadel, our forces will position a repair kit on the island’s east side. Make sure to use the repair kit if needed while attacking the Imperium citadel.
SPYINFO_END

DESCRIPTION_BEGIN
Recently, local Imperial supporters aided an Imperium invasion of Solaris. To stop the Imperium from creating a military outpost in this sector, it is essential that we seize control of Solaris. As Solaris borders our home worlds, controlling Solaris and the rest of this system will put momentum behind the Uprising.
DESCRIPTION_END



